    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need to ask u something kinda weird... i dont know if ur the right one to ask but i've been noticing something at my job. literally every time i get really upset or even just really angry, the lights in my cubicle area start flickering or my monitor will just glitch out. it's happened like 4 times this week. does that like... sound like it could be some kind of physical energy projection or something from my nervous system? it's getting hard to ignore.",
