      "content": "i tried talking to it but they just said it's \"coincidence\" or a bad wire. but it's not just random... it's timed perfectly. like, i'll be sitting there feeling this intense surge of heat or frustration and the lights dim at that exact second. it almost feels like i'm leaking something. i've been reading a bit about bioelectricity and how our nervous system carries charge... do u think there's any way a person could actually trigger an electromagnetic interference just by being in an intense emotional state?",
